{"id":"wb-3-134","name":"牛街礼拜寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"牛街礼拜寺","text":"牛街礼拜寺，位于北京市西城区牛街街道牛街18号，是北京市历史最悠久、规模最大的清真寺，也是世界著名清真寺之一。牛街礼拜寺是全国重点文物保护单位。\n礼拜寺始建于辽朝，辽亡之后归金朝。民间传蒙古军攻破金中都之后，礼拜寺被毁。如今的牛街礼拜寺是在明朝重建的基础上，经历清朝、民国，现代几度修复扩建而成的建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%89%9B%E8%A1%97%E7%A4%BC%E6%8B%9C%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":94415461,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94415461","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5845ee9c0f132e676bec32fa.jpg","title":"Niujie_Mosques02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Niujie_Mosques02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/72/Niujie_Mosques02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Smartneddy","license":"CC BY-SA 2.5","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.5","caption":"​牛街清真寺位于北京广安门内牛街，是北京历史最悠久、规模最大的清真寺，也是世界上著名的清真寺之一。","width":320,"height":240}}